{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new Shopify Online Store 2.0 section called “Featured Collection — Four Products” in the Bonne Soirée style: minimal, refined, editorial, and clean.
    
    Purpose:
    
    Display products from a selected Shopify collection in a luxury editorial product grid.
    
    Desktop layout:
    
    * Display exactly four products in a single horizontal row.
    * Use four equal-width columns.
    * Never break the four products into a second row on desktop.
    * Center the product grid horizontally.
    * Use a maximum content width of 1440px.
    * Add 32px of side padding.
    * Maintain consistent spacing between all four product cards.
    * Keep all product images the same displayed size and proportion.
    * Preserve the original image proportions without distortion.
    
    Mobile layout:
    
    * Display products in two columns.
    * Keep the section fully responsive.
    * Use 12px of side padding.
    * Maintain consistent spacing between products.
    * Do not allow horizontal page overflow.
    
    Products:
    
    * Include a Shopify collection picker.
    * Display the first four products from the selected collection.
    * Include a setting to manually adjust the number of products, with four products as the default.
    * Display the featured product image.
    * Display the product title below the image.
    * Display the product price below the title.
    * If a product has a compare-at price, display both the original price and the sale price.
    * Make the product image and title clickable.
    * Link each card to its respective product page.
    * Do not display quick-add buttons, badges, overlays, descriptions, reviews, borders, shadows, or rounded corners.
    
    Background:
    
    * Set the entire section background color to `#ebe4d8`.
    * The background color must extend across the full browser width.
    * Apply `#ebe4d8` behind the product cards, images, titles, prices, margins, gaps, and all spacing.
    * Product cards must also use the background color `#ebe4d8`.
    * Do not display any white backgrounds, white cards, white strips, or white gaps anywhere in the section.
    * Keep the same background color on desktop and mobile.
    
    Spacing:
    
    * Add adjustable top and bottom spacing settings.
    * Default desktop top and bottom spacing: 32px.
    * Default mobile top and bottom spacing: 20px.
    * Include adjustable desktop and mobile side padding.
    * Include an adjustable gap between product cards.
    
    Settings:
    
    * Collection picker.
    * Optional section heading.
    * Adjustable number of products.
    * Adjustable maximum section width.
    * Adjustable desktop and mobile side padding.
    * Adjustable product-card gap.
    * Adjustable top and bottom spacing.
    * Option to show or hide product prices.
    * Option to show or hide the section heading.
    
    Style:
    
    The result should feel like a luxury fashion e-commerce product selection.
    
    Use clean typography, balanced spacing, and an editorial layout consistent with the Bonne Soirée aesthetic.
    
    The section must be fully responsive and compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
    
    Do not output Markdown code fences such as “```liquid” as visible text anywhere in the section., Desktop layout:
    
    Display exactly four products in a 2 × 2 grid.
    Display two equal-width product columns per row.
    The first two products must appear in the first row.
    The next two products must appear directly below them in the second row.
    Center the product grid horizontally.
    Use a maximum content width of 1440px.
    Add 32px of side padding.
    Maintain consistent horizontal and vertical spacing between all product cards.
    Keep all product images at the same displayed size and proportion.
    Preserve the original image proportions without distortion.
    Do not display all four products in a single horizontal row.
    
    Mobile layout:
    
    Maintain the two-column layout, displaying two products per row.
    Display the four products in two rows.
    Use 12px of side padding.
    Keep the section fully responsive.
    Maintain consistent spacing between products.
    Do not allow horizontal page overflow.
    Product titles and prices must fit correctly within their columns.
    
    Products:
    
    Include a Shopify collection picker.
    Display the first four products from the selected collection.
    Include a setting to manually adjust the number of products, with four products as the default.
    Display the featured product image.
    Display the product title below the image.
    Display the product price below the title.
    If a product has a compare-at price, display both the original price and the sale price.
    Make the product image and title clickable.
    Link each card to its respective product page.
    Do not display quick-add buttons, badges, overlays, descriptions, reviews, borders, shadows, or rounded corners.
    
    Background:
    
    Set the entire section background color to white (#ffffff).
    The white background must extend across the full browser width.
    Apply white (#ffffff) behind the product cards, images, titles, prices, margins, gaps, and all spacing.
    Product cards must also use a white background.
    Do not display any contrasting background colors, colored strips, or colored gaps anywhere in the section.
    Keep the same white background on desktop and mobile.
    
    Spacing:
    
    Add adjustable desktop top and bottom spacing settings.
    Add separate adjustable mobile top and bottom spacing settings.
    Default desktop top and bottom spacing: 32px.
    Default mobile top and bottom spacing: 20px.
    Include adjustable desktop and mobile side padding.
    Include separate adjustable horizontal and vertical gaps between product cards.
    Ensure there is clear and consistent spacing between the first and second product rows.
    
    Settings:
    
    Collection picker.
    Optional section heading.
    Adjustable number of products.
    Adjustable maximum section width.
    Adjustable desktop and mobile side padding.
    Adjustable horizontal product-card gap.
    Adjustable vertical product-card gap.
    Adjustable desktop top and bottom spacing.
    Adjustable mobile top and bottom spacing.
    Option to show or hide product prices.
    Option to show or hide the section heading.
    
    Style:
    
    The result should feel like a luxury fashion e-commerce product selection.
    
    Use clean typography, balanced spacing, and an editorial 2 × 2 layout consistent with the Bonne Soirée aesthetic.
    
    The section must be fully responsive and compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
    
    Do not output Markdown code fences such as “```liquid” as visible text anywhere in the section., Reduce the product grid maximum width to 900px on desktop.
    Center the grid horizontally.
    Keep the 2 × 2 layout, with two products per row.
    Product images must scale proportionally within the narrower grid.
    On mobile, keep two products per row with 12px side padding.
    Preserve all existing settings, spacing, links and the white background.
    Do not change any other element of the section., Reduce the product grid maximum width to 700px on desktop.
    Center the grid horizontally.
    Keep the 2 × 2 layout, with two products per row.
    Scale the product images proportionally within the smaller grid.
    On mobile, keep two products per row with 12px side padding.
    Preserve all existing settings, links, spacing and the white background.
    Do not change any other element of the section.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: {{ block.settings.spacing_top_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.mobile_padding }}px {{ block.settings.spacing_bottom_mobile }}px;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #000000;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    column-gap: {{ block.settings.horizontal_gap }}px;
    row-gap: {{ block.settings.vertical_gap }}px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-image-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-placeholder-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-placeholder-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding-top: 12px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-title-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    color: #000000;
    font-weight: 400;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #000000;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.spacing_top_desktop }}px {{ block.settings.desktop_padding }}px {{ block.settings.spacing_bottom_desktop }}px;
    }

    .ai-featured-collection-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .ai-featured-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-featured-collection-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-featured-collection-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: 16px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-featured-collection-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.show_heading and block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-featured-collection-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.heading }}
      </h2>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-featured-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.collection != blank %}
        {% for product in block.settings.collection.products limit: block.settings.products_to_show %}
          <div class="ai-featured-collection-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-featured-collection-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-featured-collection-image-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if product.featured_image %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                    alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                    class="ai-featured-collection-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}"
                    height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                  >
                {% else %}
                  <div class="ai-featured-collection-placeholder-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="ai-featured-collection-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-featured-collection-title-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h3 class="ai-featured-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ product.title }}
                </h3>
              </a>

              {% if block.settings.show_price %}
                <div class="ai-featured-collection-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                    <span class="ai-featured-collection-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {{ product.compare_at_price | money }}
                    </span>
                  {% endif %}
                  <span>{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        {% for i in (1..4) %}
          <div class="ai-featured-collection-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-featured-collection-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-featured-collection-placeholder-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-featured-collection-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-featured-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                Product {{ i }}
              </h3>
              {% if block.settings.show_price %}
                <div class="ai-featured-collection-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  R$ 199,00
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Featured four products",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "products_to_show",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 8,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 4,
      "label": "Products to show"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_heading",
      "label": "Show heading",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading text",
      "default": "Featured collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Product display"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_price",
      "label": "Show price",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "horizontal_gap",
      "min": 8,
      "max": 60,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Horizontal gap",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "vertical_gap",
      "min": 8,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Vertical gap",
      "default": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "max_width",
      "min": 1000,
      "max": 1600,
      "step": 20,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Maximum content width",
      "default": 1440
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "desktop_padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Desktop side padding",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "mobile_padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Mobile side padding",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "spacing_top_desktop",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Desktop top spacing",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "spacing_bottom_desktop",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Desktop bottom spacing",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "spacing_top_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Mobile top spacing",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "spacing_bottom_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Mobile bottom spacing",
      "default": 20
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Featured four products"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
